\cf0 Yes\'97and this is one of Sanity's biggest strengths.\
The answer is 
\f1\b far more than CSS
\f0\b0 . You're not just skinning an existing CMS like WordPress; you're building your own editing experience. The "Studio" is a React application, so you can customise almost everything.\
Here's what you can do.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

