\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Yes. Since the Studio is built with React, you can customise it extensively and make it feel like a bespoke admin application rather than a generic CMS. Many agencies deliver Sanity studios that clients don't even realise are based on a CMS\'97they just feel like purpose-built internal tools.\
